      "content": "look, an onsite survey right now would take three days and kill the entire phase. the crew is already saying they \"think\" it's fine, but they aren't engineers so I can't rely on them. if i tell the board we need a full audit because of \"chatter,\" they're going to breathe down my neck about why the automated auditor didn't catch it earlier. \n\njust give it to me straight—if we skip the manual survey and move to the next stage based on your digital read, are we looking at a legit structural risk or is this just sensor noise? i need to know if i can confidently sign this off as meeting all specs.",
